apps/mobile/android/app/*.jks
apps/mobile/android/app/*.keystore
apps/mobile/macos/
apps/mobile/linux/
apps/mobile/windows/
apps/mobile/web/
# Firebase konfiguratsiyasi — maxfiy emas, lekin loyihaga xos
